From 9593451ca468391e020a57f5288a39856fba98ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: stephan-xyz <stephan@zehrer.xyz>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 11:52:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] bcm2835-spid: SPI0 of the Raspberry Pi as a scheme

/scheme/spi/0/cs0 and cs1: a write is one full-duplex transfer, the next
read gives the bytes clocked in; speed and mode files. GPIO 7 to 11 go to
ALT0 through bcm2835-gpiod. Polled, no DMA.

Refs #42

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
